  "baseline_note": "Pinned upstream author sources used as a teaching case for touch-driven 2D particles over a 3D character. Static review covers the ordinary header petting path, distance and time emission, particle parameters, motion, painting and page refresh. Numerical examples are formula evaluations; strict distance resampling and isolated repaint are proposed extensions, not upstream behavior. No device frame-rate, latency, sampling-invariance or large-timestep validation is implied. The upstream LICENSE was read at the pinned revision; source files are not mirrored in this repository.",
